lua-cmsgpack
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

src/dmsgpack.c derives from lua-cmsgpack 0.4.0 -- specifically its msgpack
format-byte tables, its integer and collection header width ladders, and its
runtime endianness swap. The buffer, the integer decoding, the float width
policy, the array-versus-map rule and everything concerning ext codes were
written for Diluvium; the header of that file records which is which and why.

  Copyright (C) 2012 Salvatore Sanfilippo.  All rights reserved.

Licensed under the MIT license. The notice is reproduced in full at the foot
of src/dmsgpack.c.

